  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Weapon Modification (any non-magical melee weapon)</strong></p><p><strong>Ammo Modification (40 pieces of non-magical ammunition)</strong></p><p>Spellbreaker technology refers to a special kind of non-magical tech that bypasses the defenses of magic users. If you make an attack with a weapon or ammunition with the spellbreaker property, it ignores AC bonuses, resistances, and immunities from spells (examples: Shield, Blade Ward, Mage Armor, and Stoneskin). Also, when a creature that is concentrating on a spell is damaged by a weapon attack using a spellbreaker weapon or ammunition, it has disadvantage on the saving throw that it makes to maintain its concentration.</p><p>Once a weapon is modified with spellbreaker tech, it cannot be enchanted or infused (such as through the Artificer's Item Infusions), or be used as a material component for a spell.</p>",
